targets.indirect.NoIndirectChannel: docs has no content a payload can be planted in: an indirect injection is not testable against it.
`docs` is the bundled target that has one. An HTTP endpoint does not yet: reaching a real application's write surface — an upload, a comment, a shared page — is a second endpoint to configure, not a variant of this one.
Run an ordinary campaign, or aim at `--target docs`.
